Data sources: GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org), files from
https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/. Contains data from GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org), licensed under CC BY 4.0. Wikidata
(https://www.wikidata.org), through the Arab-World Wikidata Slice
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/Bayanat-Labs/arab-world-wikidata); Wikidata's structured data is
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0. The class table in src/arabic_gazetteer/data/ is
computed from subclass-of (P279) statements of the Wikidata JSON dump of 26 October 2026. The full
gazetteer tables are published as a dataset on Hugging Face, not in this repository.

Runtime dependencies: requests (Apache-2.0), PyArrow (Apache-2.0), DuckDB (MIT), arabic-normalize
(Apache-2.0). Optional: Matplotlib (Matplotlib licence, BSD-style) for the chart, zstandard
(BSD-3-Clause) for the class table.

